{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615130/extras/70b03511045341bd9b7983a9c16ac88c.poster.avif?t=1769283106\" width=616 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615130/extras/70b03511045341bd9b7983a9c16ac88c.webm?t=1769283106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615130/extras/70b03511045341bd9b7983a9c16ac88c.mp4?t=1769283106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615130/extras/3b4e6c7e51377eae146be76f587a0ce2.avif?t=1769283106\" width=616 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the world of Cozy Room Decorator </strong>where you\u2019re the chief curator of cozy and it\u2019s up to <i>you</i> to define what cozy means. Whether that means a lived-in kitchen space filled with sweets, or a tech-laden game room, the combinations are waiting to be explored. Dive into a world of boundless imagination and creativity with a treasure trove of thousands of items, each brimming with endless possibilities. Equipped with your very own room, this whimsical isometric room design game invites you to unleash your inner interior decorator. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Is It?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy Room Decorator is a casual room decorating game that offers players an opportunity to unleash their creativity. Gameplay is as simple as drag and drop what you want into the space. Players are given a room template that has a fixed isometric view, so two walls and a floor are the \u201cshell\u201d of the room. At game start up, players are given a catalog full of items to use in their rooms. There will be a variety of items to choose from so the player can decide what style of room they want. Some examples of items are bedroom furniture, kitchen appliances, and bathroom items. We\u2019ve also done away with item collision restrictions, so players can merge items together to create \u201cnew items\u201d. There is no overarching plot to the game, nor are there any side quests or prerequisites that may hinder one from decorating within gameplay. There is no in-game currency system that forces a player to \u201cbuy\u201d furniture for their rooms. The objective of Cozy Room Decorator is simply to decorate. This game is especially for those that want to put together an aesthetic room, but perhaps don\u2019t want to deal with the hassle and headache of learning a 3D modeling program.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615130/extras/abf8b045296fe543d97eeb0fea46e05b.avif?t=1769283106\" width=616 height=76 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615130/extras/cea9f594bbfa9833ca2c1d0f1e4b75ef.poster.avif?t=1769283106\" width=616 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615130/extras/cea9f594bbfa9833ca2c1d0f1e4b75ef.webm?t=1769283106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615130/extras/cea9f594bbfa9833ca2c1d0f1e4b75ef.mp4?t=1769283106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cozy Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your room to show your unique style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from thousands of items!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate Inside and Outside.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the walls, floors or background of your room.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from different lighting options, time of day or weather patterns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick different art options for different photo frames that you decorate with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the ambient noise sound effects to set the mood of your environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the location of your room for a change of scenery! <br>   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collision is disabled to allow merging items so players can be very creative!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sandbox game. There is no story. Just decorating at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the grid on or off, there is no grid-snapping by design. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A truly unique and beautiful soundtrack, hand crafted by the Lucky Roll team!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy our wallpaper mode. Hide the interface and use your room as a desktop wallpaper!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615130/extras/be82d3bf12760f8f6a083b6713e3c0c1.poster.avif?t=1769283106\" width=616 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615130/extras/be82d3bf12760f8f6a083b6713e3c0c1.webm?t=1769283106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615130/extras/be82d3bf12760f8f6a083b6713e3c0c1.mp4?t=1769283106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615130/extras/e5ab04598202d3dfb031d6d01f82c9ce.avif?t=1769283106\" width=616 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > We post patch notes, road maps and game updates for all of our games in our discord! For Cozy Room Decorator in specific we have a place to share your rooms with other decorators, a place to request features and of course many rooms to chat about the game. Meet other like-minded people and become a part of the Lucky Roll community. We'll be waiting!  </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Getting Started","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2615130/37c7713edeb56b64358f67e68b914206c8e61256.jpg"},{"name":"I'm Famous","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2615130/336c76efde592b2097b1474b2912e0b6b0ef2206.jpg"},{"name":"Maxed Out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2615130/17f5bdf86032b111cf11359f4c7c6f559056454b.jpg"},{"name":"Spacing Out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2615130/f331ad9e827fe7ab3bd43f6391b343bee9855308.jpg"},{"name":"Outside The Box","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2615130/4bd045bd8bc72d047b6d54738309a60b5c6daac4.jpg"},{"name":"Art Curator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2615130/764973b66705d117f6c044471558ad4c920e9e02.jpg"},{"name":"Nesting","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2615130/16bbc9a8ebef1ce2274d8700de3b311ab0ee7ab1.jpg"},{"name":"Go Potty!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2615130/99f4c96f6d91147de7dba5013e02455cffa5d78a.jpg"},{"name":"Snack Attack","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2615130/7268e2f894d46f32733b090c2291f7b912bb62e9.jpg"},{"name":"Its Not A Phase!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2615130/1f8dd74de795f1f29f8e68215f0d443e7259d75a.jpg"}],"total":25},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2615130?t=1769283106","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615130/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769283106","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615130/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769283106","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615130/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769283106","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2778870,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615130/extras/70b03511045341bd9b7983a9c16ac88c.poster.avif?t=1769283106\" width=616 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615130/extras/70b03511045341bd9b7983a9c16ac88c.webm?t=1769283106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615130/extras/70b03511045341bd9b7983a9c16ac88c.mp4?t=1769283106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615130/extras/3b4e6c7e51377eae146be76f587a0ce2.avif?t=1769283106\" width=616 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the world of Cozy Room Decorator </strong>where you\u2019re the chief curator of cozy and it\u2019s up to <i>you</i> to define what cozy means. Whether that means a lived-in kitchen space filled with sweets, or a tech-laden game room, the combinations are waiting to be explored. Dive into a world of boundless imagination and creativity with a treasure trove of thousands of items, each brimming with endless possibilities. Equipped with your very own room, this whimsical isometric room design game invites you to unleash your inner interior decorator. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Is It?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy Room Decorator is a casual room decorating game that offers players an opportunity to unleash their creativity. Gameplay is as simple as drag and drop what you want into the space. Players are given a room template that has a fixed isometric view, so two walls and a floor are the \u201cshell\u201d of the room. At game start up, players are given a catalog full of items to use in their rooms. There will be a variety of items to choose from so the player can decide what style of room they want. Some examples of items are bedroom furniture, kitchen appliances, and bathroom items. We\u2019ve also done away with item collision restrictions, so players can merge items together to create \u201cnew items\u201d. There is no overarching plot to the game, nor are there any side quests or prerequisites that may hinder one from decorating within gameplay. There is no in-game currency system that forces a player to \u201cbuy\u201d furniture for their rooms. The objective of Cozy Room Decorator is simply to decorate. This game is especially for those that want to put together an aesthetic room, but perhaps don\u2019t want to deal with the hassle and headache of learning a 3D modeling program.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615130/extras/abf8b045296fe543d97eeb0fea46e05b.avif?t=1769283106\" width=616 height=76 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615130/extras/cea9f594bbfa9833ca2c1d0f1e4b75ef.poster.avif?t=1769283106\" width=616 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615130/extras/cea9f594bbfa9833ca2c1d0f1e4b75ef.webm?t=1769283106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615130/extras/cea9f594bbfa9833ca2c1d0f1e4b75ef.mp4?t=1769283106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cozy Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your room to show your unique style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from thousands of items!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate Inside and Outside.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the walls, floors or background of your room.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from different lighting options, time of day or weather patterns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick different art options for different photo frames that you decorate with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the ambient noise sound effects to set the mood of your environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the location of your room for a change of scenery! <br>   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collision is disabled to allow merging items so players can be very creative!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sandbox game. There is no story. Just decorating at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the grid on or off, there is no grid-snapping by design. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A truly unique and beautiful soundtrack, hand crafted by the Lucky Roll team!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy our wallpaper mode. Hide the interface and use your room as a desktop wallpaper!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span cla